{"server":"cn","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_06_beg","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_06","title":"补票！","storyCode":"RS-6","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"8b84235d36ee25637ae68919f433bb9038f3f2803c66306118b4449f02606b4d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雪地中，阿克托斯与烈夏相认。锏的出现更加证实了“灰礼帽”的猜测，他决定转换目标前往湖心岛，而锏不打算让他得逞，二人之间展开追逐。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗莎琳是坏孩子！\n她没有爸爸，我们不要和她一起玩，她是个怪胎！\n哈哈哈，罗莎琳是没爸爸的坏孩子！\n我才不是坏孩子！\n你们、你们不许乱说......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哎哟！她、她动手打人！她就是坏孩子！\n上！我们揍她！\n揍她！\n打就打，谁怕谁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不是坏孩子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我有妈妈就够了，才不需要爸爸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"才不需要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到从上头摔下来，竟然误打误撞，让我给找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"双生树......原来是藏在这儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是两棵树长在一起，应该没错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......这样就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老妈的事算是办完了，现在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是不行，爬不上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的积雪太厚，山壁太陡，徒手爬不上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只剩下这边的断崖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，罗莎琳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别太靠近那边，小心危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，行，我不过去，你别乱动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的腿还动不了吧？别逞强，先坐着歇会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那么严重，我总不能让你摔着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这帮维多利亚来的混账竟然把主意打到你身上，这事不能就这么完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以那家伙真是维多利亚的间谍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......他也没把我怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到真出事可就太迟了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是时机不对，我一定要揍到他再也不敢踏进我佩尔罗契家的领地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是大叔你突然出现，我本来就打算把那家伙绑起来教训一顿的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，不提这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚，那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我最烦拖拖拉拉磨磨蹭蹭的，我就直接问了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那啥，刚刚摔下来的时候，你为什么要给我垫背？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有那个维多利亚来的，他说的什么身份，你知道是什么意思吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道现在说这些，你可能不好接受，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和塔季扬娜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我和你母亲，就是在这座山的山顶认识的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和老妈......你的意思是，你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是你想的那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳，你是我的女儿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g11_karlanheadquarters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这真是稀客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托丝，什么事能让你这样急着上门来见我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该很清楚我为什么来，恩希欧迪斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定按照我们现在的做法，一点没根没据的诱导，就能骗得过那个维多利亚的“灰礼帽”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越聪明的人，越容易对自己的判断深信不疑，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是恩希欧迪斯，我也要告诫你，别太小瞧其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然那维多利亚密探看起来确实被误导了，开始追着那个阿克托斯的女儿跑，但我可不觉得事情会这么顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一他没有按照你想的那样行动，你准备怎么处理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该不会没有后手吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯的女儿在这时回到谢拉格，这件事本身就在我们的计划之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自然不可能认为这样临时起意的计划能够解决所有问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来，你是有另外的计划了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看......今天怎么没见到诺希斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有平常都在你身边的那个女护卫，我听我那妹妹和妹夫说，最近几天那位没怎么在山上帮你训练山雪鬼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的消息很灵通，菈塔托丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺希斯和锏自然都有他们的工作，如果你是来见他们俩的，那么今天可能要让你失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没什么事要找他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然说......是呢，如果诺希斯在的话，我这里倒是有个“好消息”要告诉他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什么大事，明天你就会知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然和诺希斯也说过，但我还是要亲口提醒你，恩希欧迪斯，耶拉冈德像之下的事，你最好是真的有把握......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这已经不是你希瓦艾什一家的事，我布朗陶家也将码都押在上头了，你可千万记住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铭记在心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论是三家，还是圣女大人领导的蔓珠院......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托丝，你应当更有信心一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不论你我，还是诺希斯，甚至锏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们所有人都是为了谢拉格的将来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希欧迪斯","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我如此深信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跑够了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我要收回刚才说的话，锏女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聪明的脑袋里又想到了什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑骑士确实不会骗人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我擅自误解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以为罗莎琳小姐，会是谢拉格布局中关键的一环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若非如此，也不至于我稍稍表现出要与其接触的意向，就出现了这么多线索......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏女士，您不是来阻止我接近阿克托斯和罗莎琳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是来加深这种误会的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聪明人总是话多，我搞不懂，也懒得理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，拿起你的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我试试维多利亚的爪牙有多锋利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我投降，锏女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之间有什么斗争的必要呢？这整条线索都是错误的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得对，我该下山吃午饭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灰礼帽”坦然地举起双手，走过锏的身边。\n但是，当他走到锏的背后时，他忽然停住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是我的一些小小猜测，锏女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据我所知，恩希欧迪斯不是一个无的放矢的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果罗莎琳小姐真的毫不重要，我不相信他会以此为饵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳小姐确实没有嫌疑。那么，问题会不会出在她身后的佩尔罗契家上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会不会，佩尔罗契家运的酒，或者说，佩尔罗契家安排的运输线路有问题？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳小姐的出现是个纯粹的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而正因为如此，你们担心我见到罗莎琳小姐之后，可能会阴差阳错地查到佩尔罗契家，发现一些我不该发现的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"才演了这样一出戏给我看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锏没有说话，只是缓缓举起了手中的锏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"佩尔罗契家负责了谢拉格各种资源的运输。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而谢拉格所有运输铁路有一个共同的汇聚点，那就是银心湖。进一步说，重要的......是耶拉冈德像脚下的湖心岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座耶拉冈德像上，恐怕有些秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情报人员会把自己的答案说出来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人各有长。论武力，放眼整个维多利亚您也是翘楚。可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您并不能完美控制那些自己都意识不到的细微表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为我猜对了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"锏毫不留情地挥下武器，然而，“灰礼帽”早有准备。\n他避过气浪，避过飞雪，避过杀意，向着山下大步而去。\n锏紧随其后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g8_kjeragstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通往银心湖的驮兽观览车即将发车。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过专业训练的驮兽，能带你走过每个景点，看到最好的风景！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要观赏沿途风景的旅客不要错过！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去银心湖，给我一头最快的驮兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最快的可要加钱，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多少钱都行。我正在被一个非常邪恶的人追杀，就当帮我个忙，朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是有人问你我的去向，你就告诉她，你不知道，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在我女儿寄给我的那些碟片里看过这样的情景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就它了，我手下最快的孩子，塔克米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我不会告诉别人的，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“灰礼帽”敏捷地跳进驮兽背上的座位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"而后，驮兽迈开脚步，向着银心湖开始奔跑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，外国人还真有意思，等女儿回来可得给她说道说道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有看到一个身穿黑色大衣的外国人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真来了！抱歉，我没——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，锏小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘了吗，去年我家塔克米拉货的时候陷进泥潭里，是你路过把它拉出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，确实有这么一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你没看到是吗，那我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个混账，居然骗我说锏小姐是坏人，我还把塔克米交给他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我非得给他点教训不可！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"牧民说着，拿起了一个对讲机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔克米！停下，那是个坏人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，驮兽的机动能力确实不容小觑，关键是，它的耐力也非常强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定确实可以作为一种战略资——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胯下的驮兽忽然开始不安分地躁动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"出租驮兽的牧民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐，塔克米在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧——被发现了吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放弃吧，今天无论你想做什么，我都会看着你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我只是想去观光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对谢拉格还算了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可担当不起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g10_iceonlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天一定要学会滑冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话你已经说了一个月了，再学不会夏天都要到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到时候又要等很久湖面才能结冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我今天一定要学会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，借工具一用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我的滑冰鞋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用这些钱去买双新的吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在四处调查的时候，“灰礼帽”曾经见过冬日的暖阳下，谢拉格人在冰面上滑行的情景。\n他觉得这种活动确实有些乐趣，如果有时间的话，他也想尝试一下。\n没想到机会这就来了。\n但他马上发现自己错估了一件事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，咦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥们，我还以为你会滑冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这一看就是新手，重心不稳啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摔倒的“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重心？哦，我懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摔倒的“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，糟了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让开一点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊，天上有个人飞过来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重心，重心，对，对，我明白了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“轰”的一声，冰面在锏的攻击下裂开了一个巨大的口子。\n千钧一发之际，“灰礼帽”闪开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g10_iceonlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，我学会了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太愉快了，回国之后，我一定要推广一下这项运动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，首先我得活过今天才行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g10_iceonlake"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"活泼的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他他他，他居然就会了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从没见过这么快学会滑冰的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。还有别的滑冰鞋吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，要不，我的借你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的谢拉格人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
